senses.gloss:
सुषि, इस्, f. (for शुषि, q. v.), drying; a hole,
cavity; a tube, pipe; (इस्), m. an opening, aperture;
[cf. देव-स्˚.]

शुष्म, अस्, आ, अम्, strong, powerful (Ved.);
(अस्), m. power, strength, vigour (Ved.); the sun;
fire, flame, light; air, wind; a bird; (अम्), n.
strength, prowess (= बल, Naigh. II. 9); light,
lustre.
